sequenceDiagram
  participant F as AIBO-FRONTEND
  participant B as AIBO-BACKEND
  participant E as AIBO-ENGINE
  participant M as MongoDB
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  F->>B: /api/v1 request
  B->>B: auth + validation
  B->>M: users/sessions/tasks/schedules
  B->>P: project management
  B->>E: POST /ai-engine/analyze
  E-->>B: classification + entities
  B->>E: POST /decision-engine/decide
  E-->>B: task type + actions
  B-->>F: API envelope
